      "side": 1,
      "message": "As I understand the code, you will get here only by first removing the bond, or by doing CTKD on Classic using SMP.\n\nNot sure why clearing keys here is required. Maybe if you bonded over LE first, then bond on Classic and do CTKD to generate LE keys ?\n\nIMHO this patch shouldn\u0027t touch this either.",
      "parentUuid": "2444b359_68511579",
